The table structure information is ({database name: {schema name: [table name]}}): 
{'bigquery-public-data': {'libraries_io': ['repositories', 'dependencies', 'projects', 'versions', 'projects_with_repository_fields', 'repository_dependencies', 'tags']}}
Some few-shot examples may be useful:
Query:
-- 1)  Dependency entries that mention LaunchDarkly in the dependencies table
SELECT DISTINCT
  dependency_name,
  platform,
  dependency_platform
FROM `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.dependencies`
WHERE LOWER(dependency_name) LIKE '%launchdarkly%'
LIMIT 20;
Answer:
dependency_name,platform,dependency_platform
launchdarkly-eventsource,NPM,NPM
launchdarkly-nodeutils,NPM,NPM
@flopflip/launchdarkly-wrapper,NPM,NPM
LaunchDarkly.Common,NuGet,NuGet
D2L.LaunchDarkly.EventSource,NuGet,NuGet
D2L.LaunchDarkly.Common,NuGet,NuGet
Query:
-- 2)  Dependency entries that mention Unleash-client in the dependencies table
SELECT DISTINCT
  dependency_name,
  platform,
  dependency_platform
FROM `bigquery-public-data.libraries_io.dependencies`
WHERE LOWER(dependency_name) LIKE '%unleash%'
LIMIT 20;
